Mean pF for Swedish tills in the database. Based on statistical 
analysis of water retention comprising 37 Swedish till profiles with 
different textures. Coefficients for the Brooks & Corey function are 
estimated from the arithmetic mean of the water content at eight 
different pressure heads. 

Estimated Brooks and Corey parameters are reported in Lundmark & Jansson: Generic soil 
descriptions for modelling water and chloride dynamics in the unsaturated zone based on 
Swedish soils. Submitted December 2007 to Geoderma.

Stockholm 2005-10-19, 2008-03-17
Annika Lundmark 
